{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4","text":"# Alvin\n- ⛪ Priest of the Hometown church."},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":220,"height":190,"file":"Sprites/Alvin_overwolrd.webp"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Gerson Boom**\nHis father, deceased before the start of the game."},{"id":"s1","type":"text","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Asriel**\nAs a child, he used to \"confess\" fake sins to him as a game, many of them in Kris's name."},{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Susie**\nIt's she who rewrites Gerson's final letter for him in Ch.4, though they never actually interact on screen."},{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1","text":"**Did Alvin unknowingly open the church's Fountain?**\nThe Dark Fountain of the First Sanctuary in the church is notably smaller than usual, suggesting little determination was involved in opening it — and the game itself establishes that whoever opens it usually does so thinking of a..."},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/alvin_in_the_grave_of_his_father.png","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/asriel.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/alvin_susie_discover_gerson_dust.webp","x":420,"y":10,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Angel**\nFirmly believes in the faith and the Prophecy, and treats him with genuine religious respect. In Ch.5 he attributes the church's damage to him, describing it as \"winds of great change.\"","x":760,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/The_Legend_screenshot_Angel%27s_Heaven.webp","x":1134,"y":360,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/alvin_church_at_night_dark_fountain.png","x":-91,"y":865,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_gerson_susie","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_fuente_angel","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_asriel_fuente","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"1"}]}